  "1. Turn the OD and bore (H7) in one setup; cut the keyway 90° from where the slit will go.",
  "2. With the part still solid, drill the clearance hole and counterbore on the head-side jaw, then drill and tap the far jaw, square to the slit plane at the screw offset. Drilling before slitting keeps the holes aligned.",
